ORDERS ["Build palisades on the north switchback approach without blocking the trestle or ore-cart route.","Save until 25g, then build a sentry beacon covering the north approach and existing turret.","Prioritize coal thieves, then steam wreckers, then rail toughs.","Keep the hero near the boiler-house site and intercept any enemy that reaches the top terrace.","After the immediate wave is secure, save 70g and build a boiler house beside the northern coal seams.","Preserve a clear route across the trestle for the Railhead Escort."]
